  (descr "Cherry MX style mechanical keyboard switch, Kailh/Gateron hot-swap socket and through-hole soldering, double-sided mounting. An alternative to \"SW_MX_HotSwap_THT_double\". Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: 3.00u (courtyard 57.10x19.00mm). For plate-mount stabilizers (no PCB holes needed).")
